<title>UK: UBS buys Belgium's Mister Minit from founder.</title>
<headline>UBS buys Belgium's Mister Minit from founder.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Capital BV, part of Union Bank of Switzerland, said on Monday it would buy Belgian shoe repair and key cutting company Mister Minit from the firm's founder, Donald Hillsdon Ryan.</p>
</text>
